The following commands have been enhanced to use the new ID resolution system:

1. **`dev_get_window_info`**: Enhanced window information retrieval
2. **`dev_focus_window`**: Improved window focusing with fallback ID resolution
3. **Future commands**: All new window operations will use this pattern

